# ============================================================
# Research: Inner Laws
# ============================================================
research.magianaturalis.intro.name=Inner Laws
research.magianaturalis.intro.text=Understand the essence of things to understand the essence of their existence.
research.magianaturalis.intro.page.1=All thaumaturges can manipulate the essence of the magic we now call Vis, yet few have managed to escape corruption and darkness as successfully as you have. Your deep connection with the natural flow and its primal phenomena has given you an understanding of the true beauty of this material world.<BR>Other naturalists claim they can manipulate life itself, and the structure of nature and living beings. They believe they have discovered the essence of our existence...
research.magianaturalis.intro.page.2=Unfortunately, the predecessors of Thaumcraft never designed intuitive labels for essentia containers (such as Essentia Phials, Wispy Essence, and the like). You can only vaguely distinguish what aspect is sealed within a bottle by its faint color&mdash;hardly a pleasant experience in a laboratory full of jars.<BR>Fortunately, that is now possible.<BR><BR>Press the [Toggle Aspect Icons] key (default: O) to see the aspect icon sealed within directly in the corner of the item slot; press it again to hide all of them
research.magianaturalis.intro.page.3=<IMG>magianaturalis:textures/misc/introback/magianaturalisenus.png:0:0:255:255:0.55</IMG>

# ---- Woods ----
research.magianaturalis.carpentry.name=Woods
research.magianaturalis.carpentry.text=Building Blocks
research.magianaturalis.carpentry.page.1=Tired of always using the same magical Wood for building you decided to simply carve on it. A couple of etchings here, a bit of gold there, sticking together Slabs and the Result was better than anything you ever imagined.

# ---- Transcribing Table ----
research.magianaturalis.transcribing_table.name=Transcribing Table
research.magianaturalis.transcribing_table.text=Physical transportation of knowledge
research.magianaturalis.transcribing_table.page.1=You realized that the knowledge released by the Deconstruction Table is fleeting and hard to share. Thus, you crafted this Transcribing Table.<BR>Place an empty "Research Log" in the top-left slot and have an original Deconstruction Table nearby. This table will slowly "transcribe" and seal ambient aspects and research points into the log.<BR>A full log can hold up to 64 points of each of the 6 primal aspects. When another thaumaturge reads this filled log, they gain all the research points within. This is the best way for thaumaturges to trade and inherit knowledge.
research.magianaturalis.transcribing_table.page.2=Note: the transcribing table must leave a gap between itself and the surrounding deconstruction tables.<BR>Otherwise, it will forever remain a wooden frame that refuses to turn.<BR><BR>Thaumaturges call this gap "the breathing room of knowledge."<BR>Others insist it is simply because the first person to build a transcribing table placed one block off by accident, and no one since has dared to question it.

# ---- Research Log ----
research.magianaturalis.research_log.name=Research Log
research.magianaturalis.research_log.text=Collecting Knowledge for Anyone
research.magianaturalis.research_log.page.1=This thick Tome can store Research Points as Words written down with magical Scribing Tools. If Anyone reads this Book they gain all Research Points contained within. The words disappear from the pages leaving behind a blank Research Log.

# ---- Thaumium Key ----
research.magianaturalis.arcane_keys.name=Thaumium Key
research.magianaturalis.arcane_keys.text=One to Rule them All...
research.magianaturalis.arcane_keys.page.1=This Key grants Access for the Bound Player to any arcane block owned by the Key Forger.
research.magianaturalis.arcane_keys.page.2=This Key adds a list of players to the access list of the arcane blocks owned by the Bound Player or Key Forger.

# ---- Arcane Chest ----
research.magianaturalis.arcane_chest.name=Arcane Chest
research.magianaturalis.arcane_chest.text=An obstinate private vault, guarding its treasures
research.magianaturalis.arcane_chest.page.1=Amidst dust-laden tomes, I uncovered the lost art of binding a soul to wood. It defies mundane destruction and knows only its master.<BR>Greatwood Chest: 54 slots. Silverwood: 77 slots. Left-click with a key to grant access (None, Access, Admin). Sneak + right-click with a wand to shrink it, items and access preserved (Owner/Admin only).<BR>Creative mode ignores all limits.
research.magianaturalis.arcane_chest.page.2=Greatwood is cheap for early game. Silverwood holds 23 more slots for team vaults. Share: Left-click with a key. Revoke: Break and replace.<BR>Admins can shrink but not transfer ownership. Shrunk chests retain all items and access across dimensions.

# ---- Chaos Goggles ----
research.magianaturalis.dark_goggles.name=Chaos Goggles
research.magianaturalis.dark_goggles.text=I see Your glowing Red Eyes
research.magianaturalis.dark_goggles.page.1=Dissecting spiders led you to the link between darkness and cloaking.<BR><BR>[ Features ]<BR>· Reveal Nodes: See them without a Thaumometer.<BR>· See the Unseen: Invisible creatures become visible.<BR>· Blindness Immunity: Removes Blindness while worn.<BR>· Vis Discount: 5% on all aspects; <B>Entropy</B> is higher—9% by day, 7% by night.<BR><BR>Forged from Spider Eyes and shards of chaos. Wear it, and the days of being startled by the unseen are over.
research.magianaturalis.dark_goggles.page.2=[ Cost & Purpose ]<BR>Infusion requires Spider Eyes, iron, and chaos shards, and leaves warp upon your soul. Its greatest difference from the Spectacles is that it truly sees through invisibility.<BR><BR>[ Recommended ]<BR>· Jungle temples and abandoned mineshafts.<BR>· Duels against invisible opponents.<BR>· Rituals consuming heavy Entropy.<BR><BR>[ Warning ]<BR>Worn long enough, you will suspect something else is in the dark. It is not your imagination.

# ---- Spectacles ----
research.magianaturalis.spectacles.name=Spectacles
research.magianaturalis.spectacles.text=Sharper Sight
research.magianaturalis.spectacles.page.1=You fitted a gold rim upon your Thaumometer lens. Secrets now reveal themselves without holding the tool.<BR><BR>[ Features ]<BR>· Reveal Nodes: See them without a Thaumometer.<BR>· HUD Readout: Shows node type/modifiers, or the owner of Arcane Doors, Glass, and Chests.<BR>· Vis Discount: A flat 6% on all aspects.<BR><BR>Wear it, and you will see at a glance who this world belongs to.
research.magianaturalis.spectacles.page.2=[ Why You Need It ]<BR>Frees your hands—survey nodes with a wand, or build with a tool. The flat 6% discount is balanced across all aspects.<BR><BR>[ Crafting & Cost ]<BR>Built upon a Thaumometer, aided by gold and leather. No infusion, no warp.<BR><BR>It is the first pair of goggles every thaumaturge should own.

# ---- Focus of Construction ----
research.magianaturalis.construction_focus.name=Focus Of Construction
research.magianaturalis.construction_focus.text=Grand Architecture
research.magianaturalis.construction_focus.page.1=While the Shovel of the Earthmover already possessed a slight potential at building in a bigger manner, you have refined and expanded the shear Potential to its maximum. This Masterpiece of Focus etching has brought forth a Tool befitting a Grand Architect.

# ---- Focus of the Revenant ----
research.magianaturalis.revenant_focus.name=Focus Of the Revenant
research.magianaturalis.revenant_focus.text=Annoying touch of death
research.magianaturalis.revenant_focus.page.1=Your run-ins with baby zombies left you thoroughly acquainted with the annoyance of small, fast-moving foes. You have uncovered a way to summon these little rascals for a short while and sic them on your enemies.<BR>They will not touch the innocent—villagers and livestock are left alone. They fixate on the single target you point them at, and scatter the moment it falls. You can command five at a time at most; any further summons must wait for one of them to fade. They come and go in a hurry—but that is more than enough to show your enemies what it feels like to be swarmed by a pack of brats.

# ---- Jar of Binding ----
research.magianaturalis.prison_jar.name=Jar of Binding
research.magianaturalis.prison_jar.text=To hold a life within one's palm
research.magianaturalis.prison_jar.page.1=From ensorcelled glass you have wrought this "Jar of Binding." Within it, common creatures may be sealed—though never a boss, and never a player. Right-click a creature with an empty jar, and it is drawn inside.<BR>The sealed jar gives off a faint glow. To free the creature, set the jar upon the ground and strike it with your wand; the glass shatters, and the creature is loosed.<BR>Break the jar by hand, and the creature will not escape—instead, the jar falls as an item bearing the creature's essence, a safe vessel for your pets and traps. Strike it with a weapon, however, and whatever lies within will break loose.

# ---- Phenomorphous Stone ----
research.magianaturalis.mutation_stone.name=Phenomorphous Stone
research.magianaturalis.mutation_stone.text=Morphing the Visual
research.magianaturalis.mutation_stone.page.1=Change the appearance of Blocks such as Wool, Hardened Clay, Wood, Logs and Stone Bricks. All pheno-morphable block are highlighted when looking at them simply click the block to swap it appearance. Sneak to rotate Logs & Stairs.

# ---- Quicksilver Stone ----
research.magianaturalis.quicksilver_stone.name=Quicksilver Stone
research.magianaturalis.quicksilver_stone.text=Quickening Potion Effects
research.magianaturalis.quicksilver_stone.page.1=Shortens and condenses the Effects of Potions at the same time. Makes the Effect Stronger, but last shorter. Needs Glowstone to operate.

# ---- Vicious Traveling Trunk ----
research.magianaturalis.evil_trunk.name=Vicious Traveling Trunk
research.magianaturalis.evil_trunk.text=Soul-infused combat backpack
research.magianaturalis.evil_trunk.page.1=You infused a warped soul into a traveling trunk, creating this loyal Corrupted Trunk.<BR>It serves as a mobile backpack with 36 slots, and as a powerful combat pet (75 HP, 6 ATK) immune to fire and drowning.<BR>It follows you and fiercely fights back when you are attacked. Non-sneaking right-click opens its inventory; feeding it restores its health.<BR>Left-click it with a Golem Bell to pick it up as an item.

# ---- Sinister Trunk ----
research.magianaturalis.sinister_trunk.name=Sinister Trunk
research.magianaturalis.sinister_trunk.text=Soul-infused combat backpack
research.magianaturalis.sinister_trunk.page.1=This is a variant of the Vicious Traveling Trunk. It is merely a different appearance; its combat abilities are identical to the base version.<BR>Infusing a soul into the trunk gives it this sinister form.

# ---- Demonic Trunk ----
research.magianaturalis.demonic_trunk.name=Demonic Trunk
research.magianaturalis.demonic_trunk.text=Soul-infused combat backpack
research.magianaturalis.demonic_trunk.page.1=This is a variant of the Vicious Traveling Trunk. It is merely a different appearance; its combat abilities are identical to the base version.<BR>Infusing a soul into the trunk gives it this demonic form.

# ---- Tainted Trunk ----
research.magianaturalis.tainted_trunk.name=Tainted Trunk
research.magianaturalis.tainted_trunk.text=Soul-infused combat backpack
research.magianaturalis.tainted_trunk.page.1=This is a variant of the Vicious Traveling Trunk. It is merely a different appearance; its combat abilities are identical to the base version.<BR>Infusing a soul into the trunk gives it this tainted form.

# ---- Focus Ender Pouch ----
research.magianaturalis.ender_pouch.name=Focus Ender Pouch
research.magianaturalis.ender_pouch.text=Cross-dimensional arsenal
research.magianaturalis.ender_pouch.page.1=This is the ultimate form of the Focus Pouch. You bound it to your Ender Chest, creating a cross-dimensional storage device.<BR>Simply right-click to access your Ender Chest anytime, anywhere. Even better, it synchronizes the Foci within, allowing you to swap wand focuses on the fly.<BR>Equip it in your Baubles (Belt) slot, and it will travel with you across all dimensions, serving as your most reliable mobile arsenal.

# ---- Sickles ----
research.magianaturalis.sickles.name=Sickles
research.magianaturalis.sickles.text=Reaping Crops
research.magianaturalis.sickles.page.1=Destroys Crops and Plants in a small radius of about 3x3x3 Blocks. Can harvest any Plants, Crops, Leaves, Web and other Vegetation and shear Entities such as Sheep.

# ---- Sickle of Abundance ----
research.magianaturalis.sickle_of_abundance.name=Sickle of Abundance
research.magianaturalis.sickle_of_abundance.text=Harvest Feast
research.magianaturalis.sickle_of_abundance.page.1=Evolution of the Thaumium Sickle allowing the Possessor to harvest plants in an even larger radius with a inherent abundance comparable to a fortune level of 2 which includes increased drop chances for Greatwood and Silverwood Saplings. All the harvested Loot floats towards the player.

# ---- Geo Occultism ----
research.magianaturalis.geo_occultism.name=Geo Occultism
research.magianaturalis.geo_occultism.text=Transforming Regions through Obsidian Totems
research.magianaturalis.geo_occultism.page.1=Observing and studying geographic Regions and the ancient Totems found in them you have discovered that Biomes can be transformed. The Ancients seemed to use Obsidian Totems to create artificial Geo-Poles that slowly converted the Region around them. You invented a Geo-Pylon which is attuned to a specific Region and placed on top of a 3 Block tall Obsidian Totem. Fueling it with Essentia you are able to bend the Region to your will.<BR>The max Range of the Pole seems to be a radius of 8 Blocks. A black color indicates that the Device is Idle, use your wand to activate/deactivate.
research.magianaturalis.geo_occultism.page.2=The Geo Pylon is not a magic circle. It is closer to a very hungry patch of soil.<BR><BR>To reshape a region, you need three things:<BR>· Hold the Biome Sampler, sneak-right-click the target biome, and let it memorize the local nature.<BR>· Hold the Biome Sampler, right-click the Geo Pylon, and hand that memory over.<BR>· Hold a wand, sneak-right-click the Geo Pylon, and let it recalculate the price of the transmutation.<BR><BR>What price? Essentia. The Geo Pylon does not farm—it orders from a menu. It searches within twelve blocks for available essentia jars and siphons the aspects matching the biome's nature, one by one.
research.magianaturalis.geo_occultism.page.3=If you change your mind, or find that an old bill is still unpaid, sneak-right-click once more.<BR>The Pylon will silently tear up the invoice and start a new one.<BR><BR>— Many a thaumaturge has fallen at this step: they forgot the sneak, and then watched an entire forest turn into a tainted marsh beside their own laboratory.<BR>Three of them, it is said, retired to grow potatoes.

